# Add these dependencies to your package.json:

## Production Dependencies
```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "web-vitals": "^4.2.4",
    "@google/generative-ai": "^0.21.0",
    "@react-three/fiber": "^8.17.10",
    "@react-three/drei": "^9.114.3",
    "@react-three/postprocessing": "^2.16.3",
    "postprocessing": "^6.36.2",
    "three": "^0.169.0",
    "gsap": "^3.12.5"
  }
}
```

## Dev Dependencies
```json
{
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/three": "^0.169.0",
    "@types/gtag.js": "^0.0.20"
  }
}
```

## Installation Commands

### Option 1: Install all at once (Recommended)
```bash
pnpm add web-vitals @google/generative-ai @react-three/fiber @react-three/drei @react-three/postprocessing postprocessing three gsap
pnpm add -D @types/three @types/gtag.js
```

### Option 2: Install individually
```bash
# Core Performance
pnpm add web-vitals

# AI
pnpm add @google/generative-ai

# 3D
pnpm add @react-three/fiber @react-three/drei @react-three/postprocessing postprocessing three
pnpm add -D @types/three

# Animations
pnpm add gsap

# Analytics Types
pnpm add -D @types/gtag.js
```

## Verification

After installation, verify in your package.json:
```bash
pnpm list web-vitals three gsap
```
